<font size="2" color="#000000" face="Arial">
<div>
Good day,</div>
<div>
&nbsp;</div>
<div>
My name is Sgt Lorenzo Estrada of the US Army, I mate with Mr. Masoud Karbasian, the former CEO of National Iranian Oil Company, and also former Iran minister of finance in the course of our peace keeping in Kuwait because of the Iran and Israel war. I hope this message meets you in good health. Due to the current war crisis in his country Iran at the moment, He want to invest his money outside his country Iran, the amount is $56.8 million USD. He really needs your help, that is the reason he contacted me for assistance to find someone outside his country to receive the funds on his behalf, since his own country is not good for such investment at the moment, because he has lost some of his Investment in Iran due to the recent war crisis.</div>
<div>
&nbsp;</div>
<div>
Kindly get back to me so we can proceed.</div>
<div>
&nbsp;</div>
<div>
Thanks.</div>
<div>
Sgt Lorenzo Estrada.</div>
<div>
&nbsp;</div>
